      "nodes": [
       {
        "type": "TEXT",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [],
        "textData": {
         "text": "In our Contrary Quest game line, the characters are the sloppy ones. I hope the game doesn't end up like the characters! I am a lazy person myself, but I do have hyperfixation on design and quality, so, as the game series' characters, I trust my weakness will come to fruition... especially when it'll be with friends!",
